      "id": "claim_55f1875cb5d64fe48aba238900e72e42",
      "statement": "The certificate utility commands share two infrastructure pieces: the remote-inspection helpers trimURL/getPeerCertificates in command/certificate/remote.go that let file-oriented commands accept https/tls/host:port targets, and the utils.ReadFile stdin convention where '-' reads STDIN and UTF BOMs are stripped from files.",
