    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f1c1323f081b4bc4be85b365f007b2d6",
      "statement": "Optional revocation checks: --verify-ocsp posts OCSP requests via golang.org/x/crypto/ocsp; --verify-crl downloads the CRL from --crl-endpoint or the certificate's CRLDistributionPoints, verifies its signature via crlutil (skipped under --insecure), and checks serial revocation; the issuer comes from --issuing-ca or the certificate's first AIA IssuingCertificateURL.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://command/certificate/verify.go#L269-L339",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ce14fc33e0c52ade0502039dc6f50a6de185789bd7adf39660a34a64c7a5c9c4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_0be3699e930a4415a915774d6e9673dc",
      "statement": "certificate format converts PEM and DER for certificates or CSRs (detected by the -----BEGIN prefix then parse attempts), preserving the input file's mode when using --out; certificate key extracts the embedded public key from a cert/CSR first block (or prints a lone private key), writing --out with mode 0600.",
