    {
      "id": "claim_1af94bad52cc4c51aecb01714c43695c",
      "statement": "step certificate p12 uses software.sslmate.com/src/go-pkcs12 with the Modern encoder by default and --legacy switching to LegacyRC2; with <crt> <key> it builds an identity store (first input certificate is the leaf, the rest join --ca intermediates) and with only --ca entries a trust store named '<subject> - <fingerprint>'; passwords come from --password-file or prompts, --no-password requires --insecure, and output is 0600.",
