      "id": "claim_ae853a5d1f4f45128304b23f0a3ddbb2",
      "statement": "step certificate install/uninstall delegate to github.com/smallstep/truststore, first enforcing that the input is a self-signed root CA (cert.IsCA and CheckSignatureFrom(cert) == nil); options map to truststore.WithPrefix (defaulting to the CommonName or 'Smallstep Development CA'), --all or individual --java/--firefox, and --no-system; CmdError failures surface the failed system command.",
