      "id": "claim_b7c3c3be4b10434f8e0ce39c9601d357",
      "statement": "step crl has a single subcommand, inspect; with --from <cert-or-url> it dials the host (defaulting port 443), takes the peer chain, uses the certificate's first CRLDistributionPoints entry as the CRL location, and treats the rest of the chain as candidate CAs, refusing to run without --insecure when no CA is available.",
